+    Optimize neural field parameters using pixel-level Mean Squared Error (MSE) loss $\mathcal{L}_{mse}$ and superpixel loss $\mathcal{L}_{sp}$.
+    $$ \mathcal{L}_{sp} = \ell_{error}^i + 0.001 \cdot \ell_{std\_p}^i $$
